v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78054\"><ruby>両親<rp>(</rp><rt>りょうしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ともに<ruby>健在<rp>(</rp><rt>けんざい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とは<ruby>限<rp>(</rp><rt>かぎ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Neither of my parents are alive.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">懸賞</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんしょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">悬赏；有奖竞赛；奖金；奖励</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">検事</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">检察官；公诉人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"175378\"><ruby>検事<rp>(</rp><rt>けんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>誘導尋問<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆうどうじんもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The prosecutor asked me a leading question.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">健全</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">健全的；健康的；完善的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"82831\"><ruby>母子<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ともに<ruby>健全<rp>(</rp><rt>けんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Mother and child are both doing well.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">見地</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">观点；视角；立场；实地勘察；现场勘查</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"103532\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人生<rp>(</rp><rt>じんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>すべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て、<ruby>金銭<rp>(</rp><rt>きんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>見地<rp>(</rp><rt>けんち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>る。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He sees all life in terms of money.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\" data-id=\"n1:v:顕著\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">顕著</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんちょ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">显著</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>薬<rp>(</rp><rt>くすり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>効果<rp>(</rp><rt>こうか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>顕著<rp>(</rp><rt>けんちょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>現<rp>(</rp><rt>あらわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\">药效明显地显现出来。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">顕</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">顕微鏡</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">けんびきょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">显微镜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><s